%% GTR70E WYVERN — flight state machine (custom PCB1, RP2350B, 4x 87 mm fins + active TVC)
%% Regenerated against CONFLICTS.md's frozen parameters and the corrected trajectory.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BOOT
    BOOT: BOOT — mount SD, mux + init body/external BNO085 (Game Rotation Vector), baro datum
    ARMED: ARMED — RBF pulled; launch-detect primed; camera recording
    BOOST: BOOST — F15-4; 500 Hz TVC PID stabilize→maneuver; gimbal limit ±8°
    COAST: COAST(brief) — burnout t=3.45s; NO thrust ⇒ NO TVC authority
    RECOVER: RECOVER — F15-4 motor ejection t=7.45 s, bulkhead joint separates (FC logs only)
    DESCENT: DESCENT — 24 in chute ~4.8 m/s; log to apogee+landing
    LANDED: LANDED — flush log, safe outputs
    BOOT --> ARMED: self-test pass
    ARMED --> BOOST: |a|>2g sustained 50 ms
    BOOST --> COAST: burnout (t>3.45s)
    COAST --> RECOVER: F15-4 ejection t=7.45 s
    RECOVER --> DESCENT --> LANDED --> [*]
